{"step_index":104,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-19T06:07:40Z","content":"### Accomplishments\n\n1. **Updated Desktop UI & Apps**:\n   - Replaced [`public/index.html`](file:///C:/Users/Bullettemporary/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/dump-garbage/public/index.html) with the web desktop suite containing all **17 built-in applications** (File Manager, Browser, Notes, Calculator, App Installer, Terminal, Weather, Facts, Currency Converter, Password Generator, QR Code, Unit Converter, Gallery, Music Player, Calendar, Contacts, Settings).\n\n2. **Built Standalone Bare-Metal ISO**:\n   - Installed `pycdlib` dependency and executed `iso-builder/build_real_iso.py`.\n   - **Generated ISO**: [`C:\\Users\\Bullettemporary\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\dump-garbage\\endroid-os-x86_64.iso`](file:///C:/Users/Bullettemporary/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/dump-garbage/endroid-os-x86_64.iso) (**145.27 MB**).\n\n3. **VirtualBox VM Configured**:\n   - VirtualBox VM `EndroidOS` registered with 2048 MB RAM, 2 CPUs, 128 MB VRAM, Attached ISO, and 20 GB Virtual SATA VDI storage.\n   - *Note*: Windows Hypervisor / Memory Integrity (VBS) triggered `VERR_NEM_VM_CREATE_FAILED` on direct VirtualBox launch. Disabling Windows Core Isolation / Memory Integrity in Windows Security will allow direct VirtualBox hardware acceleration.\n\n4. **Live Server Running**:\n   - The Endroid OS server is active at **[`http://localhost:8080`](http://localhost:8080)**, serving the full web desktop and system APIs.\n\n---\n\n### Detailed Walkthrough\nSee the complete summary in [`walkthrough.md`](file:///C:\\Users\\Bullettemporary\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\da9e9c42-5baf-4b67-90a8-709001879963\\walkthrough.md)."}
